      "date": "2026-05-05T11:32:09.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹18.99 (up from ₹17.16 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹16.6b (up 8.1% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹3.80b (up 11% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 23% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 6.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 1.2%. Revenue is forecast to grow 7.4% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 16% growth forecast for the Capital Markets industry in India.",
