      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.48 (up from ₹4.29 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹3.94b (flat on 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹896.1m (up 4.4% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 23% (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 7.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 8.6%. Revenue is forecast to grow 11% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 17% growth forecast for the Capital Markets industry in India.",
